OL,3,ADrugs dug up at Creamfields site ahead
OL,4,Aof festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupt Andy Blizard said: "Every year, we
OL,7,Fcounter a number of brazen individuals
OL,8,Fwho think they can outsmart us by
OL,9,Fconcealing drugs from view or burying
OL,10,Fthem at the site months in advance."
